### =====================================================
### AVAILABILITY SLOT APIs (Lecturer Only)
### =====================================================

### 1. CREATE NEW AVAILABILITY SLOT
### Method: POST /api/availability-slots
### Required: Valid JWT token with Lecturer role
POST {{AcademicAppoinment_HostAddress}}/api/availability-slots
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{BearerToken}}

{
  "startTime": "2026-08-09T10:00:00",
  "endTime": "2026-08-09T11:00:00",
  "meetingType": "Online",
  "locationOrLink": "https://meet.google.com/abc-def-ghi"
}

###

### 2. GET ALL MY AVAILABILITY SLOTS
### Method: GET /api/availability-slots/my-slots
### Returns: List of all slots created by current lecturer
GET {{AcademicAppoinment_HostAddress}}/api/availability-slots/my-slots
Authorization: Bearer {{BearerToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. UPDATE AVAILABILITY SLOT
### Method: PUT /api/availability-slots/{id}
### Example: id = 1
PUT {{AcademicAppoinment_HostAddress}}/api/availability-slots/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{BearerToken}}

{
  "startTime": "2026-08-10T14:00:00",
  "endTime": "2026-08-10T15:30:00",
  "meetingType": "In-person",
  "locationOrLink": "Room 301, Building A"
}

###

### 4. DELETE AVAILABILITY SLOT
### Method: DELETE /api/availability-slots/{id}
### Note: Can only delete if no active appointments exist
DELETE {{AcademicAppoinment_HostAddress}}/api/availability-slots/1
Authorization: Bearer {{BearerToken}}

###

### =====================================================
### APPOINTMENT MANAGEMENT APIs (Lecturer Only)
### =====================================================

### 5. GET PENDING APPOINTMENTS FOR LECTURER
### Method: GET /api/appointments/lecturer/pending
### Returns: All pending appointment requests for this lecturer
GET {{AcademicAppoinment_HostAddress}}/api/appointments/lecturer/pending
Authorization: Bearer {{BearerToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 6. APPROVE APPOINTMENT
### Method: POST /api/appointments/{id}/approve
### Example: id = 5
POST {{AcademicAppoinment_HostAddress}}/api/appointments/5/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{BearerToken}}

###

### 7. REJECT APPOINTMENT (with required reason)
### Method: POST /api/appointments/{id}/reject
### Example: id = 5
POST {{AcademicAppoinment_HostAddress}}/api/appointments/5/reject
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{BearerToken}}

{
  "reason": "I'm not available at this time. Please choose another slot."
}

###

### 8. CANCEL APPOINTMENT (Lecturer-initiated)
### Method: POST /api/appointments/{id}/lecturer-cancel
### Example: id = 5
POST {{AcademicAppoinment_HostAddress}}/api/appointments/5/lecturer-cancel
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{BearerToken}}

{
  "reason": "Emergency meeting scheduled. Need to reschedule our appointment."
}

###

### 9. MARK APPOINTMENT AS COMPLETED
### Method: POST /api/appointments/{id}/complete
### Example: id = 5
POST {{AcademicAppoinment_HostAddress}}/api/appointments/5/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{BearerToken}}

###
